Bridge for Zoo Code (github.com/quonn77/zoo-bridge)
Copyright 2026 The zoo-bridge contributors

An unofficial port of Zoo Code to OpenIDEA. Not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or maintained by Zoo Code Org. "Zoo Code" is used only to describe what this
product works with and where the work comes from.

This product redistributes, in plugin/webview/zoo/, the webview UI build of
Zoo Code (https://github.com/Zoo-Code-Org/Zoo-Code), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (plugin/webview/zoo/LICENSE.txt). Two of its files are
modified (see plugin/webview/zoo/MODIFICATIONS.md).

At run time the sidecar loads the Zoo Code VS Code extension from the user's
own installation; that extension is not redistributed with this product.

The architecture was informed by Zoo Code for JetBrains
(https://github.com/Zoo-Code-Org/Zoo-Code-Jetbrains, Apache License 2.0,
Copyright 2009-2025 Weibo, Inc.); no code of it is included.

This product includes software developed by Microsoft Corporation:
vscode-uri (MIT License, https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-uri).

This product includes ws (MIT License, https://github.com/websockets/ws).

This product uses the OpenIDEA plugin SDK
(https://github.com/l0ng-ai/openidea, Apache License 2.0).
